  "prefLabel": "Per 102.15 Broad group",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.15 “Broad group” means the occupational level of a position established by the national Standard Occupational Classification (SOC) System, which falls within the SOC major and SOC minor group levels, but above the detailed occupational level, and which is used in the NH classification system for describing positions in the classified service.\n\nSource. #13667, eff 6-22-23; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.13), eff 12-1-25",
